  - [NOT] Difficult [OR] or [NOT] impossible communication with the patient
  - Breastfeeding, pregnant [OR] or patients who plan a pregnancy while participating in the study
  - Systemic neurological disorders with mobility limitations (e.g. advanced Parkinson's disease [OR] or multiple sclerosis)
  - Patients with incompatibilities [OR] or known limitations that make participation [NOT] impossible
  - Patients after stabilization with implants on thoracic [OR] or lumbar spine.
  - [NOT] Inability to provide informed consent without a legally authorized representative.
