File: NCT03929900 

Das File: /work/eauten2s/ec_criteria_struct/lct/input/dataset/test/input/NCT03929900.txt wurde erfolgreich geladen.
Inclusion Criteria:
 -  Age [AND] 45-79 years
 -  Estimated glomerular filtration rate [AND] 20-60mL/min/1.73m2 [AND] based on CKD-EPI(Cr) equation
 -  [NOT] Non-dialysis dependent (NDD)
Exclusion Criteria:
 -  Autosomal dominant polycystic kidney disease
 -  [NOT] Unable [OR] [NOT] unwilling to give consent
 -  Previously received chronic dialysis
 -  Previous [OR] any organ transplant
 -  Patients who diagnosed heart failure with NYHA class 3 [OR] 4
 -  Known liver cirrhosis (Child-pugh class 2 [OR] 3)
 -  Pregnant women
 -  Single kidney due to trauma [OR] donation
 -  Patients who received immunosuppressive agent within the past 1 year
 -  Patients who diagnosed with glomerulonephritis through kidney biopsy
